This  Program  makes your Shell useable via Modem, NullModemConnection
or  Internet  (with  Telnetd.Device).  Very easy to use thru full GUI!
With special Modules also useable as Normal-BBS-Program with Users and
Areas.   Full  ShellSupport  with  KingCon Emulation!  Also useable as
replacement   for   the  normal  lame  Systemlevels  in  BBS-Programs.
ArexxPort   included.   Localized!   MultiPort  or  SinglePort!   Full
NullModemHandling!   Full MouseConfigurable!  Read the Introduction in
Guide.File for further Informations.
